{"term": {"label": "性", "occurrences": 1, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "右", "id": "右"}, {"form": "善", "id": "善"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "孟子", "id": "孟子"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "禹", "id": "禹"}, {"form": "羿", "id": "羿"}, {"form": "舜", "id": "舜"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "羿", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.9560625205193314, "source": "羿", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.515678308454754, "source": "羿", "target": "思"}, {"weight": 1.2992829841302609, "source": "心", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "心", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "心", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "心", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "舜", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.9560625205193314, "source": "舜", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 1.992430164690206, "source": "民", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "民", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "孟子", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "孟子", "target": "右"}, {"weight": 2.3978952727983707, "source": "孟子", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 2.4849066497880004, "source": "孟子", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 3.3141860046725258, "source": "右", "target": "師"}, {"weight": 2.1972245773362196, "source": "右", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.5040773967762742, "source": "言", "target": "善"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "言", "target":